{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "generated", "elements": [{"id": "9oodGK0AjpRwFD5LZupn", "type": "frame", "x": 380, "y": -30, "width": 1760, "height": 890, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0001", "roundness": null, "seed": 1334325801, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1395609141, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792081388038, "created": 1792081388038, "link": null, "locked": false, "name": "System diagram"}, {"id": "Q95gzVuNNdhIcfLSHcNd", "type": "text", "x": -1580, "y": -110, "width": 1023.0000000000001, "height": 37.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0002", "roundness": null, "seed": 1019403823, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 373903184, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792081388038, "created": 1792081388038, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Read N Characters Given read4 (LeetCode 158): the answer board", "fontSize": 30, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Read N Characters Given read4 (LeetCode 158): the answer board", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "yHU4kZQ66IgvsuQ7op1s", "type": "text", "x": -1580, "y": -60, "width": 891.0000000000001, "height": 18.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4b5563", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0003", "roundness": null, "seed": 673269672, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1534476150, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792081388038, "created": 1792081388038, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Coding round, 45 min. Left: what to say, in order. Right: what to draw by minute 9, then code it as a class.", "fontSize": 15, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Coding round, 45 min. Left: what to say, in order. Right: what to draw by minute 9, then code it as a class.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "AdkuILBdrYmXZqsGyV5I", "type": "text", "x": -1580, "y": 0, "width": 544.5, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1d4ed8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0004", "roundness": null, "seed": 252405811, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 429643615, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792081388038, "created": 1792081388038, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1  RESTATE  (0-2 min, say the core problem by minute 2)", "fontSize": 18, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "1  RESTATE  (0-2 min, say the core problem by minute 2)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "0V3AKaosT9mMxm0bxeNw", "type": "text", "x": -1580, "y": 26.5, "width": 528.0, "height": 160.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0005", "roundness": null, "seed": 1505229774, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1483421854, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792081388038, "created": 1792081388038, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Given read4(buf4): copies the next 4 chars of the file into\nbuf4, returns the count; 0 once the file is finished; it has\nits own file pointer.\nWrite read(buf, n): the NEXT n chars of the file into buf,\nreturn the count. Called many times, any n.\n\"So the job is: adapt a fixed-chunk reader into a variable-\nsize reader without losing or repeating a character\nbetween calls.\"", "fontSize": 16, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Given read4(buf4): copies the next 4 chars of the file into\nbuf4, returns the count; 0 once the file is finished; it has\nits own file pointer.\nWrite read(buf, n): the NEXT n chars of the file into buf,\nreturn the count. Called many times, any n.\n\"So the job is: adapt a fixed-chunk reader into a variable-\nsize reader without losing or repeating a character\nbetween calls.\"", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "W7YAdE5XIYzSPaS27z6i", "type": "text", "x": -1580, "y": 212.5, "width": 564.3000000000001, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1d4ed8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0006", "roundness": null, "seed": 943669938, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1711256041, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792081388038, "created": 1792081388038, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "2  CLARIFY  (2-5 min, ask; the answers decide the design)", "fontSize": 18, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "2  CLARIFY  (2-5 min, ask; the answers decide the design)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "42Ik8FfiWcK5Ifzv1fXL", "type": "text", "x": -1580, "y": 239.0, "width": 510.40000000000003, "height": 160.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0007", "roundness": null, "seed": 241186160, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1612144298, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792081388038, "created": 1792081388038, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Ask: is read called more than once?  (yes -> an object)\nAsk: does 0 from read4 mean the end, and is a short\n     read (< 4) NOT the end?  (yes and yes)\nAsk: if the caller asks for 1 and I pull 4, I keep the\n     other 3 for the next call?  (yes -> persistent state)\nAsk: single thread, or must it be thread-safe?\nAsk: user space or kernel? (allocation, blocking)\nAsk: can n exceed len(buf)? I cap either way.", "fontSize": 16, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Ask: is read called more than once?  (yes -> an object)\nAsk: does 0 from read4 mean the end, and is a short\n     read (< 4) NOT the end?  (yes and yes)\nAsk: if the caller asks for 1 and I pull 4, I keep the\n     other 3 for the next call?  (yes -> persistent state)\nAsk: single thread, or must it be thread-safe?\nAsk: user space or kernel? (allocation, blocking)\nAsk: can n exceed len(buf)? I cap either way.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "ZmVP9lrfyJciQftYtygV", "type": "text", "x": -1580, "y": 425.0, "width": 524.7, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1d4ed8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0008", "roundness": null, "seed": 2093459627, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2012658317, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792081388038, "created": 1792081388038, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "3  CORE ENTITIES  (the state; it lives on the object)", "fontSize": 18, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "3  CORE ENTITIES  (the state; it lives on the object)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "6xU3TRtp4HM3rIoSzTkk", "type": "text", "x": -1580, "y": 451.5, "width": 528.0, "height": 100.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0009", "roundness": null, "seed": 1190918512, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1723974093, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792081388038, "created": 1792081388038, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "hold[CHUNK]   one holding buffer, allocated once\npos           next char in hold not yet handed out\nvalid         how many chars in hold are real\neof           sticky: once read4 returned 0, never ask again\nNOT an entity: the caller's buf (theirs), the file (read4's)", "fontSize": 16, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "hold[CHUNK]   one holding buffer, allocated once\npos           next char in hold not yet handed out\nvalid         how many chars in hold are real\neof           sticky: once read4 returned 0, never ask again\nNOT an entity: the caller's buf (theirs), the file (read4's)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "EqSIg8uR7PrpytWamOrT", "type": "text", "x": -1580, "y": 577.5, "width": 59.400000000000006, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1d4ed8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0010", "roundness": null, "seed": 734624303, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1600110819, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792081388038, "created": 1792081388038, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "4  API", "fontSize": 18, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "4  API", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "Dzds8OUQkmX5wUEKNsDd", "type": "text", "x": -1580, "y": 604.0, "width": 528.0, "height": 100.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0011", "roundness": null, "seed": 1485816498, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1428983103, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792081388038, "created": 1792081388038, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "read(buf, n) -> int    up to n chars of the next part of the\n                       file into buf[0:n]; 0 only at the end\nread4(buf4) -> int     given; fills up to 4; 0 = end\ncopy(dst, d_off, src, s_off, k)   name it if the slice\n                       syntax is uncertain; define it after", "fontSize": 16, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "read(buf, n) -> int    up to n chars of the next part of the\n                       file into buf[0:n]; 0 only at the end\nread4(buf4) -> int     given; fills up to 4; 0 = end\ncopy(dst, d_off, src, s_off, k)   name it if the slice\n                       syntax is uncertain; define it after", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "cn44pzKQk5fji8sNioBb", "type": "text", "x": -1580, "y": 730.0, "width": 564.3000000000001, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1d4ed8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0012", "roundness": null, "seed": 879711783, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 859836607, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792081388038, "created": 1792081388038, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "5  INVARIANT + COST  (say it, then write it as a comment)", "fontSize": 18, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "5  INVARIANT + COST  (say it, then write it as a comment)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "vtGRuy0V6m8wPXYS5mtS", "type": "text", "x": -1580, "y": 756.5, "width": 519.2, "height": 100.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0013", "roundness": null, "seed": 2026701245, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 109536161, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792081388038, "created": 1792081388038, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "hold[pos:valid] = every char read4 returned that no caller\nhas received yet. Nothing skipped, nothing duplicated.\nTime O(n) in chars delivered: each is copied once, which is\nthe lower bound. Extra space O(1): one chunk.\nDo NOT call this brute force. There is nothing better.", "fontSize": 16, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "hold[pos:valid] = every char read4 returned that no caller\nhas received yet. Nothing skipped, nothing duplicated.\nTime O(n) in chars delivered: each is copied once, which is\nthe lower bound. Extra space O(1): one chunk.\nDo NOT call this brute force. There is nothing better.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e5XKkhSRdQddorEroEI6", "type": "text", "x": -800, "y": 0, "width": 574.2, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1d4ed8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0014", "roundness": null, "seed": 354763972, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 330233876, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792081388038, "created": 1792081388038, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "6  WALKTHROUGH WITH NUMBERS  (file abcdefg; calls 2, 3, 5)", "fontSize": 18, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "6  WALKTHROUGH WITH NUMBERS  (file abcdefg; calls 2, 3, 5)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "5JwFyk3RlQ3i73XljXqH", "type": "text", "x": -800, "y": 26.5, "width": 510.40000000000003, "height": 160.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0015", "roundness": null, "seed": 1239294915, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 801195229, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792081388038, "created": 1792081388038, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "read(2): pos == valid == 0 -> refill: abcd, valid 4, pos 0\n         take min(2, 4) = 2 -> ab; pos 2; return 2\nread(3): pos 2 != valid 4: take min(3, 2) = 2 -> cd; pos 4\n         drained -> refill: efg, valid 3, pos 0\n         take min(1, 3) = 1 -> e; pos 1; return 3\nread(5): take min(5, 2) = 2 -> fg; pos 3 = valid\n         refill -> 0: eof = true; return 2\nread(1): eof -> return 0 without calling read4", "fontSize": 16, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "read(2): pos == valid == 0 -> refill: abcd, valid 4, pos 0\n         take min(2, 4) = 2 -> ab; pos 2; return 2\nread(3): pos 2 != valid 4: take min(3, 2) = 2 -> cd; pos 4\n         drained -> refill: efg, valid 3, pos 0\n         take min(1, 3) = 1 -> e; pos 1; return 3\nread(5): take min(5, 2) = 2 -> fg; pos 3 = valid\n         refill -> 0: eof = true; return 2\nread(1): eof -> return 0 without calling read4", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "UXh8LUEhKDR8dKgLlvrd", "type": "text", "x": -800, "y": 212.5, "width": 396.00000000000006, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1d4ed8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0016", "roundness": null, "seed": 2141660912, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 42992954, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792081388038, "created": 1792081388038, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "7  TEST LIST  (write it BEFORE the code)", "fontSize": 18, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "7  TEST LIST  (write it BEFORE the code)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "W4BPUhfjiKBxUEMMqsYg", "type": "text", "x": -800, "y": 239.0, "width": 563.2, "height": 160.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0017", "roundness": null, "seed": 1005977407, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1396982519, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792081388038, "created": 1792081388038, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "[ ] empty file: first call returns 0\n[ ] n < chunk, repeated (1, 1, 1): leftovers served first\n[ ] n > chunk (10 on a 7-char file): several refills in one call\n[ ] file exactly one chunk: 4, then 0 on the next call\n[ ] short read is not the end (helper returns 1 then 4...)\n[ ] n = 0: returns 0, file untouched\n[ ] n > len(buf): capped\n[ ] threads sharing one reader: contiguous pieces, none lost", "fontSize": 16, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "[ ] empty file: first call returns 0\n[ ] n < chunk, repeated (1, 1, 1): leftovers served first\n[ ] n > chunk (10 on a 7-char file): several refills in one call\n[ ] file exactly one chunk: 4, then 0 on the next call\n[ ] short read is not the end (helper returns 1 then 4...)\n[ ] n = 0: returns 0, file untouched\n[ ] n > len(buf): capped\n[ ] threads sharing one reader: contiguous pieces, none lost", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "OCfPO443xRU7CGLXRAmj", "type": "text", "x": -800, "y": 425.0, "width": 524.7, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1d4ed8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0018", "roundness": null, "seed": 579379488, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 374020603, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792081388038, "created": 1792081388038, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "8  WHAT BREAKS FIRST  (the five defects from my mock)", "fontSize": 18, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "8  WHAT BREAKS FIRST  (the five defects from my mock)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "JLXiyY4IHFQCxhgYpn7q", "type": "text", "x": -800, "y": 451.5, "width": 536.8000000000001, "height": 100.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0019", "roundness": null, "seed": 1209505591, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 732086643, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792081388038, "created": 1792081388038, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "pos, valid, hold as locals -> leftovers lost on call 2\nno check for 0 -> take = 0, while copied < n never exits\nout[copied + take] = tmp[pos + take] -> one char, wrong index\nhold sized from the caller's buffer, re-created per call\nn not capped by len(buf) -> writes past the caller's buffer", "fontSize": 16, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "pos, valid, hold as locals -> leftovers lost on call 2\nno check for 0 -> take = 0, while copied < n never exits\nout[copied + take] = tmp[pos + take] -> one char, wrong index\nhold sized from the caller's buffer, re-created per call\nn not capped by len(buf) -> writes past the caller's buffer", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "7f4fcNOpqQM1GEEpjaoz", "type": "text", "x": -800, "y": 577.5, "width": 445.50000000000006, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1d4ed8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0020", "roundness": null, "seed": 318318136, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 580260399, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792081388038, "created": 1792081388038, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "9  EXTENSIONS  (talk, do not code; 33-40 min)", "fontSize": 18, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "9  EXTENSIONS  (talk, do not code; 33-40 min)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "LGNxTrm7fuZWdNCS10is", "type": "text", "x": -800, "y": 604.0, "width": 554.4000000000001, "height": 180.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0021", "roundness": null, "seed": 856707602, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 651979374, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792081388038, "created": 1792081388038, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Threads: one lock around read's body; read4 runs under it\n  so its pointer is safe; readers serialise, the stream is\n  sequential anyway. Parallel readers = separate streams.\nKernel: no free allocation, no blocking in the wrong context;\n  take hold from a pool at open; copy is a user-space boundary.\nBig reads: if hold is drained and n >= chunk, read straight\n  into buf and skip the copy (bufio.Reader does this).\nSame shape: Kafka fetch batches -> records; gRPC frames ->\n  messages; NIC ring buffer -> socket read.", "fontSize": 16, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Threads: one lock around read's body; read4 runs under it\n  so its pointer is safe; readers serialise, the stream is\n  sequential anyway. Parallel readers = separate streams.\nKernel: no free allocation, no blocking in the wrong context;\n  take hold from a pool at open; copy is a user-space boundary.\nBig reads: if hold is drained and n >= chunk, read straight\n  into buf and skip the copy (bufio.Reader does this).\nSame shape: Kafka fetch batches -> records; gRPC frames ->\n  messages; NIC ring buffer -> socket read.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "wKRnDPFucvzh7O2VzIu6", "type": "text", "x": 420, "y": 14, "width": 742.5000000000001, "height": 18.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6b7280", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "9oodGK0AjpRwFD5LZupn", "index": "a0022", "roundness": null, "seed": 1333722725, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1085160035, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792081388038, "created": 1792081388038, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "THE CALL   (my code is the orange box; everything it keeps between calls is the green one)", "fontSize": 15, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "THE CALL   (my code is the orange box; everything it keeps between calls is the green one)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "AnYmbnlHrVJa0vQgHTgI", "type": "rectangle", "x": 420, "y": 60, "width": 300, "height": 110, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#f3f4f6", "fillStyle": "solid", 