ss": null, "seed": 1547546740, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1105748199, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792081388038, "created": 1792081388038, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "eof: return what\nwas copied", "fontSize": 13, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "eof: return what\nwas copied", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "Xs9zRVTSNrdFjZ3V39GH", "type": "text", "x": 420, "y": 600, "width": 1138.5, "height": 37.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#dc2626", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "9oodGK0AjpRwFD5LZupn", "index": "a0056", "roundness": null, "seed": 720077628, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1604061623, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792081388038, "created": 1792081388038, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "WHAT BREAKS FIRST: state in locals (call 2 starts with an empty bag) \u00b7 no check for 0 (the loop never exits at the end) \u00b7\na one-character assignment where a slice was needed \u00b7 n not capped by len(buf). Four lines of code; the second call decides the interview.", "fontSize": 15, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "WHAT BREAKS FIRST: state in locals (call 2 starts with an empty bag) \u00b7 no check for 0 (the loop never exits at the end) \u00b7\na one-character assignment where a slice was needed \u00b7 n not capped by len(buf). Four lines of code; the second call decides the interview.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "JvPiFQKWRCxikWs47WAT", "type": "text", "x": 420, "y": 670, "width": 1163.25, "height": 37.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "9oodGK0AjpRwFD5LZupn", "index": "a0057", "roundness": null, "seed": 1874097759, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1382300231, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792081388038, "created": 1792081388038, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "NUMBERS TO SAY OUT LOUD: O(n) in chars delivered, the lower bound \u00b7 O(1) extra, one CHUNK (4 or 4096 bytes) \u00b7 refill only when pos == valid \u00b7\n0 is the end and it is sticky; a short read is not \u00b7 tests: empty \u00b7 n < chunk \u00b7 n > chunk \u00b7 exactly one chunk \u00b7 short read \u00b7 n = 0 \u00b7 threads.", "fontSize": 15, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "NUMBERS TO SAY OUT LOUD: O(n) in chars delivered, the lower bound \u00b7 O(1) extra, one CHUNK (4 or 4096 bytes) \u00b7 refill only when pos == valid \u00b7\n0 is the end and it is sticky; a short read is not \u00b7 tests: empty \u00b7 n < chunk \u00b7 n > chunk \u00b7 exactly one chunk \u00b7 short read \u00b7 n = 0 \u00b7 threads.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "4A8nu38jBhMrQajXk8Dz", "type": "text", "x": 420, "y": 750, "width": 52.800000000000004, "height": 20.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "9oodGK0AjpRwFD5LZupn", "index": "a0058", "roundness": null, "seed": 505091687, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1220218195, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792081388038, "created": 1792081388038, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Legend", "fontSize": 16, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Legend", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "eEo9DcW9cdBfckVQScg3", "type": "rectangle", "x": 420, "y": 780, "width": 22, "height": 22, "an